# Solution processed inorganic V2Oxas interfacial function materials for inverted planar-heterojunction perovskite solar cells with enhanced efficiency

Solution processed inorganic $\mathsf{V}_{2}\mathsf{O}_{x}$ as interfacial function materials for inverted planar-heterojunction perovskite solar cells with enhanced efficiency
